sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant API as Modular monolith
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant W as Outbox worker
  participant N as Notification adapter
  participant S as Search/reporting projection
  API->>DB: Begin business transaction
  API->>DB: Persist reservation/payment state + outbox event
  DB-->>API: Commit atomically
  W->>DB: Claim event with lease / SKIP LOCKED
  W->>N: Deliver idempotently
  N-->>W: Accepted / retryable failure
  W->>DB: Mark delivered or schedule bounded retry
  W->>S: Project versioned event asynchronously
  S-->>W: Acknowledge offset/watermark
  Note over DB,S: Projection lag is observable; source-of-truth remains PostgreSQL
